[35.074531, "o", "<!-- never-leaves: produced offline by a local model -->\r\n\r\n# Quote for Jenna\r\n\r\n> **DRAFT.** Written on your machine by a local model. Read it, fix it, then send it.\r\n\r\n| Field | Value |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Client | Jenna |\r\n\r\n## Scope of work\r\nReplace six downlights in kitchen ceiling. Install two new warm white downlights. Add three double GPOs in the shed. Run cable from switchboard to shed.\r\n\r\n## What is included\r\nSix downlights replacement. Two warm white downlights. Three double GPOs. Cable run to shed.\r\n\r\n## What is excluded\r\nSwitchboard upgrade. [EXCLUSIONS]\r\n\r\n## Price\r\n| Item | Rate | Total |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| Downlights (6) | [RATE] | [TOTAL] |\r\n| Downlights (2 - Warm White) | [RATE] | [TOTAL] |\r\n| GPOs (3) | [RATE] | [TOTAL] |\r\n| Cable Run (18m) | [RATE] | [TOTAL] |\r\n| Labour | [RATE] | [TOTAL] |\r\n\r\n## Timeframe\r\n[TIMEFRAME]\r\n\r\n## Terms\r\nThe [DEPOSIT] is [AMOUNT] upon acceptance of this quote. Any changes to the scope of work will require a revised quote. Jenna must confirm this quote within [NUMBER] days of receipt.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Before you send this\r\n\r\n- FILL THESE IN. [AMOUNT], [DEPOSIT], [EXCLUSIONS], [NUMBER], [RATE], [TIMEFRAME], [TOTAL]\r\n\r\n## Run record\r\n\r\n| Item | Value |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Produced | 2026-10-08T03:40:20+00:00 |\r\n| Document | quote |\r\n| Model | gemma-3-4b-it-Q4_K_M |\r\n| Model file sha256 | not computed |\r\n| Notes sha256 | d291ff019c90a55b2130539c2961d4549b2b04ba7c2ab993f4edd8b864782ccd |\r\n| Draft sha256 | 0239861b57ed81f25809a1b62b69bbc326979f8c971c98359d268bcef9604225 |\r\n| Network | kernel-isolated, no route |\r\n| Interfaces | lo |\r\n| Open IP sockets | 0 |\r\n\r\nThis record exists so you can tell later whether this file changed after you produced it. It is written to your disk and to nowhere else.\r\n"]
